# Live, Digital Reference.

**Authors:** Kenney, Brian

## Abstract
Discusses digital reference services, also known as virtual reference, chat reference, or online reference, based on a round table discussion at the 2002 American Library Association annual conference in Atlanta. Topics include numbers and marketing; sustainability; competition and models; evaluation methods; outsourcing; staffing and training; and future possibilities. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ661343

